  {
    "name": "docs",
    "description": "`operation` names one of these operations; the other arguments are its parameters (`?` marks an optional one).\n- `docs_get` (identifier, scope?): One documentation entry by variable name or filename (with or without `.md`): its register, tags and source, a 500-character `excerpt` and the full markdown `body`.\n- `docs_related` (ref, scope?): A register's related documents (rehosted PDFs): title, source, license, and the `sha256` and `byte_size` of the bytes `/api/docs/file/{ref}/{filename}` serves. `ref` is a register FQID or a bare name.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$defs": {
        "Scope": {
          "description": "The read scope (section 7); every read takes it.",
